# Calculators and the spreadsheet.
shot    rpn
cap     An RPN calculator: 12 and 34 pushed, added, then the square root of
cap     two to fifteen places.
run     /dd/CMDS/rpn
wait    2
send    12\r
wait    1
send    34\r
wait    1
send    +\r
wait    1
send    2\r
wait    1
send    q\r
wait    2

shot    rechne
cap     rechne, a German command-line calculator.  It answers in decimal,
cap     hex and binary at once.
run     /dd/CMDS/rechne 4095 x 16
wait    2
run     /dd/CMDS/rechne -b 12345
wait    3

shot    loan
cap     The amortisation calculator: principal, rate and term in, the
cap     monthly payment and the schedule out.
run     /dd/CMDS/loan
wait    2
send    100000\r
wait    1
send    7.5\r
wait    1
send    30\r
wait    4

shot    oleo
cap     GNU Oleo 1.6, the other spreadsheet here.  A2 holds =A0+A1 and the
cap     cell line at the top shows the formula behind the value.
run     /dd/CMDS/oleo
wait    4
send    12\r
wait    1
send    30\r
wait    1
send    =A0+A1\r
wait    3
quit    \030\003

shot    hc
cap     hc, the hex calculator, on an expression.
run     /dd/CMDS/hc -l "0x1f * 3 + 7"
wait    3
